                                <path d="M12.75 14.0001H11.25L12 10.5001L12.75 14.0001Z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                            </svg>
                            Cloud Security
                        </dt>
                        <dd class="inline">
                            End-to-end multi-cloud security: hardening configurations, meeting compliance, and operationalizing security tools for lasting protection.
                        </dd>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Cloud Migration & Cost Optimization -->
                    <div class="relative pl-9 max-w-sm w-full sm:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3">
