                            </svg>
                            DevSecOps / DevOps
                        </dt>
                        <dd class="inline">
                            Secure, automated pipelines and infrastructure as code—so you can deliver faster, safer, and more reliable software at scale.
                        </dd>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Kubernetes -->
                    <div class="relative pl-9 max-w-sm w-full sm:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3">
